  "charter_dependency": "Section311 requires conformity to White Oak Initiative Coalition Charter adopted March21,2023 or a successor, with statutory duties in addition to charter duties. Exact incorporated charter not supplied by checked sitemap/leadership/history context; report119-434 repeats the dependency and does not substitute for the charter. Current mission and2026-29 strategic plan are not the dated charter.",
  "remaining_material_scope": "Further exact-reference review across forest/fireshed, tribal contracts, grant portal, Stafford authorities, biochar, WhiteOak fund/charter and casualty assistance still required. Prior23 private captures are preserved research, not collectively declared reviewed or newly registered evidence. Current governed Foundation charter is reusable with board-only citizenship and exact3709(a) exception retained; no blanket beneficiary citizenship inferred.",
